# Disposable PostgreSQL data directories created for live migration/adversarial
# validation testing (Phase 5K/6J live-execution passes). These are throwaway
# test artifacts, never a project deliverable, and must never be committed --
# a PostgreSQL data directory contains thousands of internal files that would
# bloat the repository for no reason. Curated raw evidence lives under
# docs/phase-05-database-design/5K/execution_logs/ and .../5K/validation/ instead.
.tmp_pgdata_*/
.tmp_valid_logs/

# Python bytecode cache left behind by running Alembic locally for validation
__pycache__/
*.pyc
